{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35732","headline":"览友生古风 · 李咸用","name":"览友生古风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯牙鸣玉琴，幽音随指发。\n不是锺期听，俗耳安能别。\n高山闲巍峩，流水声呜咽。\n一卷冰雪言，清泠冷心骨。\n分明古雅声，讽谕成凄切。\n皴皵老松根，晃朗骊龙窟。\n荆璞且深藏，瑉石方如雪。\n金多丑女妍，木朽良工拙。\n奸宄欺雷霆，魑魅嫌日月。\n蝶迷桃李香，鲋惘江湖阔。\n不寐孤灯前，舒卷忘饥渴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}